	<item>
		<title>Thanksgiving Chess Tournament</title>
		<description><![CDATA[Come join the UOG Chess Club for a special Thanksgiving chess event!<br /><br />Starting at 2 p.m., the event will feature a chess demonstration from Carmina Ramas of her best game from the Samarkand Chess Olympiad.&nbsp;<br /><br />Following the demo will be a chess tournament. All UOG students, faculty, and staff are welcome to participate!]]></description>
